          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 25 2025 21:59:44 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><b><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sterilizable</span></b></p>\n<p>Allows for use as a surgical reference in the operating room.<br>\n</p>\n",
